      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/mohemd_ali\">@Mohemd_Ali</a></p>\n<p>Website Setting is where you can set App name and similar stuff as following;</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/6/1675267ed32baad6cf32f850e8c3d046badfe82c.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1675267ed32baad6cf32f850e8c3d046badfe82c\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/6/1675267ed32baad6cf32f850e8c3d046badfe82c_2_690x340.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"3cFuRNmrut29B0PLAKXBO5ZK7q4\" width=\"690\" height=\"340\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/6/1675267ed32baad6cf32f850e8c3d046badfe82c_2_690x340.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/6/1675267ed32baad6cf32f850e8c3d046badfe82c_2_1035x510.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/6/1675267ed32baad6cf32f850e8c3d046badfe82c_2_1380x680.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF8EF\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1848×912 102 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
