      "created_at": "2025-08-17T13:13:02.922Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/mohemd_ali\">@Mohemd_Ali</a></p>\n<p>The product page outside EPRNext is like a website for which you need to do SEO and for which you may need to ask any digital marketing team to help you optimize search engine results and it may lead traffic to your Webshop based product page hosted by ERPNext. I have not worked on them and some other contributor can help you in this thing as well.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/2/22d3d299e187f267b3c22371851760f9129e9996.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/22d3d299e187f267b3c22371851760f9129e9996\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/2/22d3d299e187f267b3c22371851760f9129e9996_2_690x347.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"4Y63Q901Hfelj8l9RE45pzFF3Rc\" width=\"690\" height=\"347\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/2/22d3d299e187f267b3c22371851760f9129e9996_2_690x347.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/2/22d3d299e187f267b3c22371851760f9129e9996_2_1035x520.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/2/22d3d299e187f267b3c22371851760f9129e9996_2_1380x694.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F4F2EA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1895×953 93.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
