      "created_at": "2025-11-05T17:19:29.632Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I fixed this by going to Website &gt; Website Settings and updating the Website Title and Footer. If you want better control over SEO stuff like meta titles or descriptions for each page, <a href=\"https://rankyak.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://rankyak.com</a> helped me out with that. It’s pretty simple to use alongside ERPNext and makes it easier to tweak those settings without messing with code.</p>",
